nt-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:15.1%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_l41q7S05HEmv-PMF4ayc8Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:OtherAccruedLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="0" id="Tc_2Zox7WICKEO-a2lA7vwphw_4_6">423,629</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:3.82%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:49.69%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 6pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Total</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:3.82%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.82%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">$</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:17.89%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2023_Wfv2SvRZ7Uet3VUQuGtxkw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AccruedLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="0" id="Tc_H4mIO93vpEW9D9IFdjrB3g_5_3">2,386,836</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:3.82%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:3.01%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:15.1%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_l41q7S05HEmv-PMF4ayc8Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AccruedLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="0" id="Tc_LY6sxCX72EKg5jKJoW0ywg_5_6">2,307,746</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:3.82%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_9_30_2023_t1V84dcu0UC9aTLzL8wINQ" name="us-gaap:DebtDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_ceU3jqFIhU-rcM8g4VuomQ" continuedAt="Tb_ceU3jqFIhU-rcM8g4VuomQ_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Note&#160;5. Debt</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">In December&#160;2020, the Company entered into a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2020_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_P4s8PBXx9k2wUyv6cXAYmQ" decimals="-6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_5TY0E-Yt-UCUym7IP8uWkA">20</ix:nonFraction> million convertible debt financing agreement with Pontifax. Under the terms of the agreement with Pontifax, the Company had access to up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2020_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_F5jtKUVpdUKH05WYXIvlxw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_R2eFwZrqSU-4Gv8Qhwti6g">20</ix:nonFraction> million in convertible debt financing in <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_12_1_2020_To_12_31_2020_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_3Fn2M5uDTUyvF1DrmCkSnQ" name="sngx:NumberOfTranches" id="Narr_fxyk5XJdMUGRy6jSqET2pQ">three</ix:nonNumeric> tranches, which will mature on June&#160;15, 2025 and had an interest-only period for the first <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_gsEovuySLkiS0sFseCw1xg;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">two&#160;years</span></span> with a fixed interest rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_9StNK0AGYUKLkwq9LOHKVQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2020_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_P4s8PBXx9k2wUyv6cXAYmQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_LAJLjITAQk2i-jGoOpLdzA">8.47</ix:nonFraction>% on borrowed amounts and an interest rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_9StNK0AGYUKLkwq9LOHKVQ" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2020_To_12_31_2020_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_3Fn2M5uDTUyvF1DrmCkSnQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityCommitmentFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_t6rGBebbwkOVzTypF9yorQ">1</ix:nonFraction>% on amounts available but not borrowed as an unused line of credit fee. After the interest-only period, the outstanding principal was to be repaid in quarterly payments of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2020_To_12_31_2020_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_3Fn2M5uDTUyvF1DrmCkSnQ" decimals="-6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPaymentPrincipal" scale="6" id="Narr_kNS2kJuyWkuD7hD7uY_kDw">1</ix:nonFraction> million each commencing in the first quarter of 2023. The agreement is secured by a lien covering substantially all of the Company&#8217;s assets, other than intellectual property. </p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Upon the closing of this transaction, the Company borrowed the first tranche of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_sngx_FirstTrancheMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_GFJs6lTSk0ic5MK_iaJkXA" decimals="-6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ConvertibleNotesPayable" scale="6" id="Narr_Jygkhv8LjEGOSjp08bemAA">10</ix:nonFraction> million, had the option to draw the second tranche of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_sngx_SecondTrancheMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_TghAgmKeiUmJMhUk_G7osw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ConvertibleNotesPayable" scale="6" id="Narr_aRv1bT3cx0CwRY6xT8PWfQ">5</ix:nonFraction> million at any time during the initial 12 months of the loan and the third tranche of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_sngx_ThirdTrancheMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_ZTabWIcgQkCw1LJ7i9WF4w" decimals="-6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ConvertibleNotesPayable" scale="6" id="Narr_zmDAQad_1EG_VNkzP2ztNg">5</ix:nonFraction> million upon filing of the HyBryte&#8482; NDA, subject to certain conditions. The Company elected to let the options to borrow both the second and third tranches expire as of December 15, 2021 and March 15, 2022, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On April 19, 2023, the Company entered into an amendment to the convertible debt financing agreement dated December 15, 2020 with Pontifax. The amendment called for the immediate payment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="Duration_4_19_2023_To_4_19_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_sngx_PontifaxMedisonFinanceMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_vSG-j60jPEGJhoF44_lPhw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_fw17pkYs_EubeXBtO3ndEw">5</ix:nonFraction> million of the outstanding principal balance and any accrued interest, waived any prepayment charge in connection with the repayment of this amount and resulted in an outstanding principal balance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="As_Of_4_19_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_sngx_PontifaxMedisonFinanceMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_INclP7dTokGSRbD0dgFKeg" decimals="-6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_sU7IZa9tDU602036y6g7oQ">3</ix:nonFraction> million. The amendment also provided for a new interest only period from the date of the amendment through June 30, 2024, reduced quarterly principal repayments from $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="Duration_4_18_2023_To_4_18_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_sngx_PontifaxMedisonFinanceMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_iq5LuaZSQkqvoek8uesCAA" decimals="-6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPaymentPrincipal" scale="6" id="Narr_3P8Jn7VV6E-xpxWXbbWpgw">1</ix:nonFraction> million to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="Duration_4_19_2023_To_4_19_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_sngx_PontifaxMedisonFinanceMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_vSG-j60jPEGJhoF44_lPhw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPaymentPrincipal" scale="0" id="Narr_kuUN9YHxCU6BFURwv9JusA">750,000</ix:nonFraction> and eliminated the minimum cash covenant. Further, the amendment reduced the conversion price with respect to the remaining principal amount under the agreement to (i) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_9StNK0AGYUKLkwq9LOHKVQ" contextRef="Duration_4_19_2023_To_4_19_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_sngx_PontifaxMedisonFinanceMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_sngx_NumberOfFirstEquityInstrumentsCommonStockIssuableUponConversionMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_7VFPLmcThkWgEazC8w4Z6A" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="sngx:DebtInstrumentReductionInConversionPricePercentageOfClosingPriceClosingPriceOfCommonStockOnDayBeforeDeliveryOfConversionNotice" scale="-2" id="Narr_WakouKx3aE2BgIPgcEqNyw">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the closing price of the Company&#8217;s common stock on the day before the delivery of the conversion notice with respect to the first <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="Duration_4_19_2023_To_4_19_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_sngx_PontifaxMedisonFinanceMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_vSG-j60jPEGJhoF44_lPhw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleNumberOfEquityInstruments" scale="0" id="Narr_b3V3-1ZdEE2J8UVrtNm70g">588,599</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock issuable upon conversion and to (ii) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_2MABQyweKUCBRFM358Glfg" contextRef="Duration_4_19_2023_To_4_19_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_sngx_PontifaxMedisonFinanceMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_sngx_NumberOfFirstEquityInstrumentsCommonStockIssuableUponConversionMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_7VFPLmcThkWgEazC8w4Z6A" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="sngx:DebtInstrumentReductionInConversionPriceNotice" scale="0" id="Narr_6R0aCLEK7UqmhkL2xvh3mA">1.70</ix:nonFraction> with respect to all shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock issuable upon conversion in excess of the first <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="Duration_4_19_2023_To_4_19_2023_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_sngx_PontifaxMedisonFinanceMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_vSG-j60jPEGJhoF44_lPhw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleNumberOfEquityInstruments" scale="0" id="Narr_WorDqexPpUm1MVFmNZ_AIQ">588,599</ix:nonFraction> shares so issued. The remaining terms of the agreement remain in effect without modification. </p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The amendment to the convertible debt financing agreement with Pontifax resulted in the extinguishment of the original convertible debt for accounting purposes. The Company concluded that the amended debt instrument has an embedded derivative that requires bifurcation pursuant to ASC 815-15-25-1 and qualifies for the fair value option in accordance with ASC 815-15-25-4 through ASC 815-15-25-6. The Company elected to account for the amended convertible debt using the fair value option, which requires the Company to record changes in fair value as a component of other income or expense.&#160; The fair value of the convertible debt on the date of the amendment was approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="As_Of_4_19_2023_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_vB3kxY09sUSHkTNQpwFH4A" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ConvertibleDebtFairValueDisclosures" scale="0" id="Narr_y_AQYPcXi0S3R6gi-hBbjg">3,304,000</ix:nonFraction>, which resulted in the recognition of a loss on extinguishment of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_9_30_2023_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_LKdsmw_lB0mfVooozk_49w" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:GainsLossesOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" sign="-" scale="0" id="Narr_oDeo22s0vEe2i8Az5tmjsQ">394,000</ix:nonFraction> on the Company&#8217;s accompanying condensed consolidated statements of operations during the nine months ended September&#160;30,&#160;2023. The fair value of the convertible debt as of September&#160;30,&#160;2023 was approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2023_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_r74kSikJ30G00vJjA3ef-A" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ConvertibleDebtFairValueDisclosures" scale="0" id="Narr_b3B7lsrk5EqUevWEitNShg">2,916,463</ix:nonFraction>, which resulted in the recognition of ($<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2023_To_9_30_2023_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_XD_paU3PW0mOSYZvTq-XbQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="sngx:FairValueAdjustmentOfConvertibleDebt" sign="-" scale="0" id="Narr_K4BVEvtpZU6Y1_nhZTp1vw">72,463</ix:nonFraction>) of other loss and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_05EMgiAukkiWXPQrhBYCGg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_9_30_2023_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember_LKdsmw_lB0mfVooozk_49w" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="sngx:FairValueAdjustmentOfConvertibleDebt" sign="-" scale="0" id="Narr_2iCw24mJXUaGR5uv6qWgzA">387,537</ix:nonFraction> of other income from the change in the fair value of the convertible debt on the Company&#8217;s accompanying condensed consolidated statements of operations during the three and nine months ended </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">19</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';" href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="Tc_3-DcqsiH70-YTdazO4w6cg_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_pOWXGW8kcUGh-NZGvw2Eug_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_3oT2-q4cTEehQ5-xHejR7g_1_5"></a><a id="Tc_LVrV6A72SkSBYG5ZFKTTUw_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_m8J5TNhe2UOWPruSoxPgEw_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_pB_qrCsrbkW00itm0gQ_IA_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_ZVkz_4Hk5U6KXmMDNM8mpg_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_vrFMnw3SKEyA9odUXdNhTA_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_spTaEbr5-EWFNgYt1lzPLg_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_pKKWs_1NEkqbJeARHzGAzQ_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_URdz-SwXoUO0lPqotAXqmg_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_48vK-y6Gx0ebGo3wY5epHg_1_5"></a><a id="Tc_Jacq76TfM0SpLCd9KRDqAw_1_8"></a><a id="Tc_r3x8gq4M20enL6LROj1HoQ_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_UowPnWb35UexVZFDeN5yyA_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_mZrGVjheW06bCDP5J0P0Vg_2_3"></a><a id="Tc__hLFxV4iPUydwhNyuB1UWw_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_2FT7LmBI80Ol5u8WjnbcxA_2_8"></a><a id="Tc_tzWfxrMCD0OfngoGlw9BOQ_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_Wh_p3AmPzUSQLSUkuvvo9Q_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_0ArYvHryK06hoVV32JW9Vg_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_3UCr0vsjX0-YlmOUI0ZWUQ_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_PanmIFiHQUebXZUglntlZA_5_5"></a><a id="Tc_mEYqUAIZ-U-Bg2gi8wnEnQ_5_8"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_ceU3jqFIhU-rcM8g4VuomQ_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">September&#160;30,&#160;2023, respectively. The fair value of the convertible debt was estimated using the Monte Carlo valuation method.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The key assumptions used in the Monte Carlo valuations were as follow:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_9_30_2023_t1V84dcu0UC9aTLzL8wINQ" name="us-gaap:FairValueAssetsAndLiabilitiesMeasuredOnRecurringAndNonrecurringBasisValuationTechniquesTableTextBlock" id="Tb_eb2P4hwsK0mA3k4h3of5Ug" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:53.72%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:4.26%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.91%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:15.95%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:4.25%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.91%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:15.95%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:53.72%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Assumptions</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:4.26%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">